        "message": "Add a shareable web page for the posting automation guide\n\nmarketing/index.html (served by GitHub Pages at /marketing/): search and\nfilter all 71 platforms (posting API, cost, Siri, users can sign in),\na detail view per platform with every automation route and its full\nhuman/agent setup, troubleshooting and sources, a hubs tab, and a\n\"For AI agents\" tab with a copyable prompt and the raw data links.\nDeep links (#p=Platform) make single platforms shareable. Linked from\nthe dashboard footer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
